      "evidence": "reflow-syncheck YAML identifies model-header AUX pointer load (1), parser IO pointer load (1), full_read clone/original with all 13 pointer fields (13+13) plus a W_SCALE-only clone (1), full_write variant with eight writable fields (8), and top initialization of all 13 pointer fields (13). Top errors comprise eight default-null fields and five bound port fields.",
      "limit": "The 27 full_read diagnostics are three transformed function variants, not 27 independent root causes. UnsupportedPtrToPtr records provide empty variable names and no checked SSA instruction; they do not isolate the exact failed alias-analysis edge."
