      "id": "A4",
      "finding": "The old fail(Controller&) edit removed that boundary but did not fix synthesis; four task wrappers already inline.",
      "evidence": "v2 linked top has no fail calls and direct cleanup. Actual reflow logs inline run_task<LoadTask/QKTask/SoftmaxTask/AVTask> before syncheck; this is later than linked gdce.",
      "limit": "Deleting another already-inlined wrapper is not an evidence-based standalone correction. Removal being insufficient does not prove fail was irrelevant in the old variant."
